  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO PROTECT PAST INVESTMENT IN THE COTONOU PORT BY CARRYING O OUT URGENT REPAIRS TO EXISTING INFRASTRUCTURE AND TO FURTHER INCREASE PORT SYSTEM PRODUCTIVITY BY MODERNIZING EQUIPMENT MAINTENANCE FACILITIES, IMPROVING PORT MANAGEMENT AND STREAMLINING INSTITUTIONS INVOLVED IN TRANSIT TRAFFIC.</narrative>
